# GraphQL API Standards

- Name types and fields in PascalCase / camelCase consistently
- Document public fields with descriptions in the schema
{{#if parameters.codeFirst}}
- Define schema in code with strong TypeScript types; export schema for codegen
{{else}}
- Keep SDL as source of truth; generate types via codegen
{{/if}}
{{#if parameters.relayStyle}}
- Use connection patterns (`edges`, `node`, `pageInfo`) for paginated lists
{{/if}}
- Validate inputs at resolver boundary; return typed errors, not generic strings
{{#if parameters.requireDataLoader}}
- Batch related entity loads with DataLoader; never query per row in a list field
{{/if}}
- Avoid over-fetching: scope selections and use field-level authorization
